  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-testid=\"video-page-container\" id=\"bbc-main\"><div><div data-testid=\"video-page-video-section\"><div><p><i id=\"warning-for-aboriginal-and-torres-strait-islander-viewers:-our-coverage-contains-references-to-and-images-of-someone-who-has-died\">Warning for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander viewers: our coverage contains references to and images of someone who has died</i></p><p>The case of a five-year-old girl who was allegedly murdered in Australia's Outback has caused outrage across the country. </p><p>The BBC's Katy Watson is in Alice Springs and explains the background of the case, the cultural sensitivities and why it has caused so much anger. </p></div><p><time datetime=\"2026-05-07T19:03:39.478Z\">2 hours ago</time></p></div><div data-testid=\"tagsAndSocialStyled\"><div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/c9em2emxdkxt\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Australian Aboriginal culture</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/cdl24gmde26t\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Indigenous Australians</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world/australia\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Australia</a></p></div></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"texas-section-outer\" data-analytics-group=\"true\" data-analytics_group_type=\"texas-20\" data-analytics_group_position=\"2\" data-analytics_group_item_count=\"20\"><div data-testid=\"texas-grid\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c5yq9wpwnvqo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6f41/live/8071f950-dbd7-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Yellow balloon with purple text reading &quot;Matilda&quot;\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Mourning outside funeral of the youngest victim of the Bondi shooting</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Matilda, 10, was mourned by family, friends, and the community in Sydney after she was killed in the Bondi shooting on Sunday.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cpq4xe72e2eo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e797/live/4f7d12d0-db32-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Rabbi Ulman speaks into microphone whilst crying\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Family gives emotional eulogy for Bondi victim Rabbi Eli Schlanger</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Rabbi Ulman, the father-in-law of British-born Rabbi Eli Schlanger, said he hoped his son-in-law knew how loved he was.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c93w7y8475qo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0070/live/99275ea0-db31-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Matilda's father, dressed in a grey pullover, embraces her weeping mother, dressed in a blue and white t shirt\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">'It's just a nightmare': Ten-year-old victim's mum speaks at Bondi memorial</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The mother of 10-year-old Matilda, the youngest victim of the Bondi Beach attack, paid tribute to her daughter at a flower memorial on Tuesday evening.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c5yjvx4vp5do\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9a55/live/df7b25e0-db03-11f0-a8dc-93c15fe68710.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BBC correspondent Katy Watson standing outside funeral in Bondi next to mourners gathering on the street\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Mourners pay tribute to Rabbi Schlanger during funeral</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">His death was described as an \"unspeakable loss\" in a service held at the Chabad of Bondi.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/ce86j91l70yo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6aa4/live/89df03c0-dae7-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BBC correspondent Katy Watson standing outside the Chabad of Bondi\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Mourners gather for Rabbi Eli Schlanger's funeral</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The first funerals are being held for victims of Sunday's mass shooting at Bondi Beach.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c1w947rpv3qo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/455c/live/06cf5110-dad3-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Split screen of two Jewish Australian women\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Jewish Australians on why Bondi is a 'sanctuary' for them</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC spoke to Jewish people at Bondi Beach about why the suburb is significant to their community.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c3e0wnv5zx2o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e1c5/live/dedbeb40-d9e8-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BBC Verify montage that combines a photo showing people running from the scene of the bondi beach attack and another one showing the shooters\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">New footage reveals how people tried to stop Bondi Beach shooting</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Eleven minutes of video captures the moment Australia's iconic beach turns into a scene of horror.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c4g40413206o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9164/live/0c9641d0-da2e-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BBC News Australia Correspondent Katy Watson stands by floral tributes to victims of the Bondi shooting.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Mountain of flowers at Bondi as Sydney mourns attack victims</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Crowds of people have left flowers and candles as a tribute to the 15 people who were killed in the attack in Sydney.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Australia</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c4gkj02ex94o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/04ca/live/6bcfed10-d982-11f0-b67b-690eb873de1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/04ca/l